  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A phosphinate ester-containing N-acyl derivative of (4<i>S</i>)-cyclohexyl-<small>L</small>-proline. It is used for the treatment of hypertension and heart failure. A pro-drug, it is hydrolysed <em>in vivo</em> to the corresponding phosphininc acid, fosinoprilat, which is the active metabolite."
  ],
